# Terraform. State is the important one: infra/main.tf provisions an Azure
# OpenAI account and writes its primary key into a Key Vault secret resource,
# and Terraform persists every resource attribute to state in plaintext. One
# `git add -A` after an apply would publish a live credential.
# The provider lock file IS committed - it pins reproducible builds.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log

# Keys and certificates, none of which belong in this repo.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa
